  "description": "The Dog Dock anchors directly to your seat using ISOFIX clips (2 on Medium, 4 on XL) , along with two reinforced straps that wrap around the seat for added stability. Inside, dual harness straps keep your dog safely positioned without restricting comfort. This multi-point anchoring system helps reduce movement during braking, turns, and long drives — creating a defined space where your dog can settle naturally. Every year, thousands of dogs are injured in cars due to poor restraint. The Dog Dock is designed to change that — giving you a safer, more controlled way to travel, and the peace of mind that your dog is secure on every journey.",
